TEXT -2872 1552 Left 2 ;Voltage conditioning cct with 2nd order low pass filter\n \n- Difference amplifier with virtual ground used to amplify and shift voltage signal. \n- Total fcutoff at 5KHz by having all poles at 7.77KHz. \n- Second order filter created by cascading 2 first order low pass filters together.
TEXT -984 1456 Left 2 ;Current conditioning cct with 2nd order low pass filter\n \n- Difference amplifier with virtual ground used to amplify and shift current shunt resistor voltage signal. \n- Total fcutoff at 5KHz by having all poles at 7.77KHz. \n- Second order filter created by cascading 2 first order low pass filters together.
TEXT -2680 176 Left 2 ;Current sens: 0.5Ohm\nPmax = 180mW
